MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5acf2cf32a9b1134ea7a8b6ad6b27ae6, type: 3}
  m_Name: Descriptions
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuacxiconSO
  categories:
  - categoryName: Locked
    contentList:
    - ????????????????????? ????????Locked???????? ???????????????????????
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: Nest
    contentList:
    - 'Nest: spawn eggs here, hutch kid ducks after a few moments.  Cost: $15 ($5
      + 5 * $2), total $15; foundation costs $5; requires 5 times to build, each
      costs $2 . Unlocking Condition: Build 1 Farmland.'
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: Farmland
    contentList:
    - 'Farmland: grow some crops, ducks can collect them when harvest, or water them
      when not. Cost: $30 ($6 + 8 * $3), total $30; foundation costs $6; requires
      8 times to build, each costs $3. Unlocking Condition: Collect 10 crumbies from
      the grass!'
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: Golden Corn
    contentList:
    - 'Golden Corn: the ducks will go straight to the nearest farm or grass when
      touching it or when the horn blows. Cost: $40 ($10 + 10 * $3), total $40; foundation
      costs $10; requires 10 times to build, each costs $3. Unlocking Condition:
      Build 2 farmlands.'
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: Playground
    contentList:
    - 'Playground: a playground could improve the happiness of the duck collided.
      Cost: $26 ($20 + 2 * $3), total $26; foundation costs $20; requires 10 times
      to build, each costs $3. Unlocking Condition: Have 5 ducks.'
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: Compost Site
    contentList:
    - 'Compost Site: when there are poops inside, every farm or grass within its
      range will produce more crumbies. Cost: $60 ($12 + 12 * $4), total $60; foundation
      costs $12; requires 12 times to build, each costs $4. Unlock Condition: Build
      3 Farmland.'
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: Secret Site
    contentList:
    - 'Mr Duckson''s Secret Site: can store crumbies here. After a few moments, it
      will return the ducks with more crumbies. Cost: Cost:$100 ($25 + 15 * $5),
      total $100; foundation costs $25; requires 15 times to build, each costs $5.
      Unlock Condition: Collect 300 crumbies from all sources.'
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: Hammer Saw
    contentList:
    - 'Hammer & Saw Symmbol: the ducks will go straight to the nearest construction
      site when touching it. Cost: $40 ($10 + 10 * $3), total $40; foundation costs
      $10; requires 10 times to build, each costs $3. Unlock Condition: Build 3 buildings
      in total.'
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: Straw Craft
    contentList:
    - 'Straw Craft: the duck will be forced to labor in it for a few moments, not
      able to get away, but will produce some crumbies when finished. Cost: $30 ($6
      + 8 * $3), total $30; foundation costs $6; requires 8 times to build, each
      costs $3. Unlock Condition: Collect 30 crumbies from Farmland in total.'
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: Altar
    contentList:
    - 'Altar: sacrifice one duck to produce more crumbies. Cost: $10 ($2 + 2 * $4),
      total $10; foundation costs $2; requires 2 times to build, each costs $4. Unlock
      Condition: Have 6 ducks.'
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: Drum
    contentList:
    - 'Duck duck Drum: speed up the ducks that collide with it or when the drum roars.
      Cost: $50 ($10 + 10 * $4), total $50; foundation costs $10; requires 10 times
      to build, each costs $4. Unlock Condition: ducks collide buildings 20 times
      in total.'
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: NestDes
    contentList:
    - Your ducks remembered how to build nests! Those should be useful in keeping
      the population from dropping. (Which would be bad.)
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: FarmlandDes
    contentList:
    - Your citizens remembered how to farm! Build and harvest from farms to keep
      them from going hungry.
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: Golden CornDes
    contentList:
    - Golden Corn Unlocked! Ducks have learnt the necessity of agriculture after
      building some farmlands, so they figured out Golden Corn to remind their farming
      agencies! (Click Twice to close)
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: PlaygroundDes
    contentList:
    - Playground unlocked! Ducks found that they started to become unhappy when there
      were too many ducks in the society. They are losing happiness because of the
      massive duck population and because of their work! They figured out the playground
      as a way to entertain themselves. (Click Twice to close)
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: Compost SiteDes
    contentList:
    - Compost Site unlocked! Ducks have learnt that farmlands can produce more crumbies
      if they throw their pops to the farmlands! (Click Twice to close)
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: Secret SiteDes
    contentList:
    - 'Mr Duckson''s Secret Site unlocked! Ducks have learnt the foundation of the
      business: invest, lend, store, and harvest by collecting a relatively huge
      amount of crumbies! (Click Twice to close)'
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: Hammer SawDes
    contentList:
    - Symbol of Hammer and Saw unlocked! Ducks have learnt the necessity of habitat
      construction after building some buildings, so they figured out Symbol of Hammer
      and Saw to remind their constructing agencies! (Click Twice to close)
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: Straw CraftDes
    contentList:
    - 'Straw Craft unlocked! Ducks have learnt a new way to produce more crumbies:
      doing labors and making the raw materials into advanced products, after collecting
      many raw materials from the farmlands! (Click Twice to close)'
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: AltarDes
    contentList:
    - Altar unlocked! Overpopulation is dangerous! Ducks have figured out a way to
      deal with this problem... Their Gods will reward them for building this altar!
      (Click Twice to close)
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: DrumDes
    contentList:
    - Duck duck drum unlocked! Ducks have learnt the benefit of walking like a New
      Yorker after working enough times in different buildings. (Click Twice to close)
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
